# Rescheduling safety

- Every conflict resolution path needs an explicit budget (max depth, max mutations, or deadline).
- Re-entry with the same disruption id must be idempotent.
- Freezes/overrides are first-class; never "optimize them away."
- Persist reason codes for mutations; support engineers need explainability.
- Prefer shadow/compare modes before changing production schedule selection.
